# Local drill/evidence dumps (repo root scratch dirs)
.drill_snapshot*/

artifacts/

# Future local scratch outputs under docs/issues should not be committed by default.
# Already tracked retained contract samples remain tracked until explicitly cleaned up.
docs/issues/issue-*.json
docs/issues/issue-*.md
docs/issues/lifecycle-audit-*.json
docs/issues/lifecycle-gate-*.json
docs/issues/lifecycle-remediation-*.json
docs/issues/pr-live-contract-check-*.md
